    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Here and there",
     "texto": [
      "**Sini** points to a place near the speaker; **situ**, a nearby place or one already mentioned; **sana**, a farther place. In English we usually use \"here\" and \"there\" with fewer distinctions."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Looking for a place",
     "texto": [
      "**Mencari** means to look for. **Bagaimana cara ke…?** asks how to get to a place. **Denah** is usually a plan of an area; **peta**, a map."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
